<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>Brain Dead</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">Beach Weather</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">Melt'd (deluxe)</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">6GFxgc38EJekjmpxs9Eh9w</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:02.505" end="00:06.441">2, 3, 4:00 a.m. got me feeling kinda dumb</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:06.441" end="00:08.273">Rollercoaster mind</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:08.273" end="00:10.241">Off my high, now I'm numb</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:10.241" end="00:12.374">So I can't shake these thoughts</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:12.374" end="00:14.803">I can taste 'em on my tongue</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:14.803" end="00:19.007">What you want from me spiritually?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:19.007" end="00:23.903">I don't even know, I don't even know why I try</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:23.903" end="00:25.965">I'm fine</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:25.965" end="00:27.785">I'm fine, 'cause I'm</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:27.785" end="00:29.332">Brain dead</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:29.332" end="00:32.028">Nothing going on upstairs</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:32.028" end="00:36.059">Faded, hearing static in my head</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:36.059" end="00:38.305">I don't want to talk about it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:38.305" end="00:42.252">I don't want to 'cause I'm brain dead</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:42.252" end="00:45.708">Brain dead</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:45.708" end="00:49.956">Nothing going on upstairs</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:49.956" end="00:52.058">Nothing going on upstairs</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:52.058" end="00:56.243">2, 3, 4:00 a.m., feeling kinda dumb</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:56.243" end="00:57.958">Rollercoaster mind</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:57.958" end="01:00.451">All the time, now I'm numb</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:00.451" end="01:02.083">I can't shake these thoughts</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:02.083" end="01:04.543">I can taste 'em on my tongue, so</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:04.543" end="01:08.641">What you want from me spiritually?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:08.641" end="01:13.556">I don't even know, I don't even know why I try</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:13.556" end="01:15.601">I'm fine</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:15.601" end="01:17.423">I'm fine, 'cause I'm</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:17.423" end="01:18.932">Brain dead</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:18.932" end="01:21.644">Nothing going on upstairs</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:21.644" end="01:25.708">Faded, hearing static in my head</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:25.708" end="01:27.867">I don't want to talk about it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:27.867" end="01:32.003">I don't want to 'cause I'm brain dead</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:32.003" end="01:35.450">Brain dead</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:35.450" end="01:39.622">Nothing going on upstairs</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:39.622" end="01:43.757">Nothing going on upstairs</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:43.757" end="01:51.757">Nothing going on upstairs</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:52.052" end="01:58.852">Nothing going on upstairs</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:58.852" end="02:00.356">Brain dead</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:00.356" end="02:03.030">Nothing going on upstairs</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:03.030" end="02:07.124">Faded, hearing static in my head</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:07.124" end="02:09.251">I don't want to talk about it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:09.251" end="02:13.300">I don't want to 'cause I'm brain dead</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:13.300" end="02:16.800">Brain dead</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:16.800" end="02:20.925">Nothing going on upstairs</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:20.925" end="02:25.125">Nothing going on upstairs</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:25.125" end="02:29.270">Nothing going on upstairs</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:29.270" end="02:37.270">Nothing going on upstairs</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:37.501" end="02:41.501">Nothing going on upstairs</p></div></body></tt>